HS.push({"ts":1785989369281,"d":"2026-08-06 13:09:29","s":"e29d6e6f","sid":"e29d6e6f-2dcb-40cb-bd2b-fed05031f034","h":"IntelliJ IDEA","repo":"happypoint-web2","br":"dev-j","w":"happypoint-web2","area":"?","n":"This session is being continued from a previous conversation that ran out of context. The summary below covers the earlier portion of the conversation.\n\nSummary:\n1. Primary Request and Intent:\n   The user develops the Happy Point homepage renewal: frontend **happypoint-web2** (Next.js 16 App Router, React 19, TS, pnpm, TailwindCSS v4, Turbopack) and backend **ha-web-api** (local `j-ha-web-api`, Spring6/Java21/Tomcat10.1 WAR, branch `dev-j`). md KB at `D:\\200_DEV\\230_WORKSPACE\\happypointcard\\md`. This continuing session had many sequential requests:\n   - **KB policy revision**: manage connected front/back repo work via umbrella task (homepage-ai-renewal); add reminder hook, verification-status fields, 🧹제거예정 rule, \"미검증도 즉시 기록\" rule; ECC-referenced improvements; permanent 짝(pairing) between ha_api↔ha_admin, loose \"탑재\" link ha_api↔ha_panel; throttle finalized at 10min.\n   - **파바앱(OPBS) 회원가입 debugging** (verified ✅ by user): find real landing URL, middleware OPBS detection (`x-requested-with=com.pb.android` header + instCd/reqPath), joinProc code=99 (2-stage: plaintext instCd decrypt + join_policy_info cookie restore), OPBS-only chrome hide (header/breadcrumb keep-space/footer/chatbot), instCd URL 관통, 본인인증 layout unify + ipin, welcome legacy match, A005/30 channel.\n   - **일반 exist-member → 비번재설정 재인증 제거** (deferred to post-deploy stabilization).\n   - **파바앱 아이디/비번찾기 URL migration** to `/page/brand/member-info/find-id-pw-{form,process,complete}` (front + backend @Mapping), keep legacy behavior, model API matched.\n   - **파바앱 find PC block + screen unify** with general (FindIdPwFlow shared), fix \"성공\" alert (bodyMode:\"form\"), no-member → brand alert.\n   - **파바앱 앱복귀 전부 제거 → `window.close()` 통일** (all brand completion/alert pages).\n   - **일반 휴면(dormancy) 흐름 신규 구축** (keep legacy `/page/dormancy/*` URLs, match model APIs, backend field alignment). \"회원가입 본인인증에서 정상 이동, 휴면 진입 시 본인인증 재수행, 입력화면, 완료화면 체크, URL/파라미터 정리.\"\n   - **Airbridge createDeeplink** on general welcome only (NOT 파바앱): \"우선 현재 젠킨스 배포, 서버 설정 변경 필요 없도록, 에어브릿지 web sdk를 회원가입 완료 페이지에 추가해줘. 환경설정 셋팅해주면 개발/운영키 넣어줄게.\" Then test console.log for the deeplink URL (🧹제거예정). MOST RECENT: put the original button's link into the deeplink's `deeplinks` field.\n\n   Security/workflow constraints (verbatim, must persist): **md 커밋·푸시는 사용자가 직접 (Claude는 파일 편집만)**; **ECC(`../ECC`) 참조 전용·절대 수정 금지**; **비밀번호·키·크리덴셜은 어떤 .env·문서에도 기재 금지** (I added empty env placeholders; user filled keys; I never printed key values); **실행 vs 확인 구분** (only file changes when explicitly told \"~해줘/진행해\"); **Atlassian 3초/회·1일 50회 공유 쿼터**; **md 현행화 상시** (auto-update worklog on every change); **유입 rewrite 절대 불변**; **파바앱은 웹 홈/앱메인 이동 없어야 함**; **파바앱 앱복귀(urlMap POST) 전부 제거 → 오직 window.close**; **🧹제거예정**로 임시/디버그 코드 관리 + 미검증도 즉시 ⏳로 기록.\n\n2. Key Technical Concepts:\n   - Next.js App Router: middleware rewrite (URL 유지, 내부 라우트 변경) vs redirect; RSC cannot set cookies (route handlers/bridges can); NEXT_PUBLIC_* env inlined at BUILD time.\n   - Middleware OPBS detection: `isOpbs = x-requested-with===com.pb.android || instCd===OPBS || reqPath===OPBS`; sets `x-hp-inst` header for layout chrome判별; `x-hp-path` = rendered route.\n   - `x-requested-with=com.pb.android` = 파바(파리바게뜨) Android webview signature (iOS has none → relies on instCd param).\n   - POST→GET bridges (Node route handlers): read body, set short cookies, navigate. Model API `@RequestParam Map` requires `bodyMode:\"form\"` (form-encoded), NOT default JSON — else `parameters={}`.\n   - `legacyContractPost(path, body, { bodyMode: \"json\"|\"form\"|\"raw\", forwardCookies, cookie, failMessage })`.\n   - Chrome hide (OPBS only): layout omits SiteHeader/SiteFooter/StickyChatbot when isOpbs; breadcrumb via CSS `[data-opbs-chrome] [data-hp-breadcrumb]{visibility:hidden !important}` (ASCII data-attr, NOT Korean aria-label).\n   - CSP in next.config.mjs: script-src, connect-src, form-action (opened/removed for 파바앱).\n   - Airbridge Web SDK via CDN (no npm dep → avoids frozen-lockfile deploy failure).\n   - encM"});
