HS.push({"ts":1786015598551,"d":"2026-08-06 20:26:38","s":"63859d39","sid":"63859d39-d0c6-4f80-80f8-e2d808ef3d2a","h":"ClaudeCode APP","area":"?","n":"This session is being continued from a previous conversation that ran out of context. The summary below covers the earlier portion of the conversation.\n\nSummary:\n1. **Primary Request and Intent:**\n\n   The conversation spans several distinct work streams for user \"dominic\" (Korean, works at SPC/happypointcard):\n\n   **A. Team worklog collection system** (`md/personal/team-worklog/`)\n   - Repeatedly: \"워크로그 현황 보여줘\" / \"한주치 더 가져와\" — collect Jira worklogs week-by-week for 17 team members\n   - Change quota policy: \"기본 매일 50회로 정책 변경해주고, 오늘만 20회 추가해줘\" (later \"오늘 50회 추가하고 계속 해\")\n   - Add rule: \"내가 별도로 요청하지 않는 이상. 무조건 한주치만 가져오도록 규칙 추가해\"\n   - Raw data policy (flip-flopped 4x, final state): store raw plain (uncompressed) in `md/personal/team-worklog/raw/`, delete after 7 days, checked at collection completion\n   - Display rule: \"데이터는 모두 수집하고, 현황판에는 확정/진행만 보여주면 돼. 캘린더에도 확정/진행 주차 데이터만\"\n   - Full wipe/restart: \"전체 초기화해\"\n   \n   **B. Calendar viewer UI** (`viewer/dashboard.html`) — many iterative refinements\n   \n   **C. Batch server failure analysis** — analyze `D:\\400_다운로드\\배치서버로그20260805`, then source `D:\\100_WORKS\\batch`, decompile classes, build API test URLs\n   \n   **D. Tracking log S3 upload** — create cron + shell script for hourly upload of ha-web-api tracking logs to S3\n   \n   **E. Obsidian setup** — \"내꺼에 설치해줘봐. 너가 권장한 설정 다 적용하고. **절대 내 md 컨텍스트 파일을 건드리게 하지 마.**\"\n\n2. **Key Technical Concepts:**\n   - Jira Cloud REST API v3: `POST /rest/api/3/search/jql`, `/issue/{key}/worklog`, `/user?expand=groups`, `/project/search`\n   - JQL worklog fields: only `worklogAuthor`, `worklogDate`(=started), `worklogComment` exist — no `worklogCreated`\n   - Issue `updated` timestamp changes when a worklog is added (verified second-exact)\n   - Overflow handling: embedded worklog limit 20/issue; `/issue/{key}/worklog` max 1048 → pagination needed (WORK-12211 total=1138)\n   - Anyframe Batch (삼성SDS), `com.sds.anyframe.batch.launcher.BatchJobLauncher`\n   - CFR 0.152 Java decompiler\n   - 공공데이터포털 APIs: `VilageFcstInfoService_2.0` (getUltraSrtNcst/getUltraSrtFcst/getVilageFcst), `WthrWrnInfoService/getPwnCd`, `B552584/ArpltnInforInqireSvc`\n   - log4j2 `fileName=` vs DirectWrite (`filePattern` only) appenders\n   - `table-layout:fixed` + `width:100%` + `<colgroup>` for table column control\n   - `scroll-margin-top` for sticky-header-aware `scrollIntoView`\n   - Obsidian vault config (`.obsidian/app.json`, `%APPDATA%\\obsidian\\obsidian.json`)\n\n3. **Files and Code Sections:**\n\n   - **`md/personal/team-worklog/tools/wl.py`** (~490 lines) — main collection tool. Commands: `day`, `seal`, `overflow`, `summary`, `viewer`, `status`.\n     - `cmd_status(today)` rewritten to filter: `SHOW = (\"확정\", \"진행\")`; shows 수집 n/7 column; team aggregation section; hidden weeks summarized as one line\n     - `cmd_viewer()` filters: `keep = [mon for mon in weeks if meta[mon][\"status\"] in SHOW]`\n     - `ingest(nodes, lo, hi)` — **docstring says 기간 필터 but code does NOT filter by date** (user said keep as-is)\n     - `rec_of()` filters: `if aid not in BY_ID: return None`\n     - Roster export now includes `team`, `roles`\n   \n   - **`md/personal/team-worklog/tools/rawstore.py`** — rewritten multiple times. Final: plain storage + 7-day retention\n     ```python\n     KEEP_DAYS = 7\n     META = os.path.join(RAW, \"_meta.json\")   # 보관일 기록 (mtime 신뢰 불가)\n     # commands: put, putov, ls, prune [--dry-run] [--today YYYY-MM-DD]\n     ```\n   \n   - **`md/personal/team-worklog/viewer/dashboard.html`** — heavily modified:\n     ```js\n     function thisMonday(){ const t=new Date(); const mon=new Date(t.getFullYear(),t.getMonth(),t.getDate()-((t.getDay()+6)%7)); return `${mon.getFullYear()}-${...}`; }\n     function initialWeek(){ /* ① this week ② latest ≤ today ③ earliest */ }\n     let wi = initialWeek(); let mode = \"team\"; let calEnter = false;\n     const TEAM = {}; D.roster.forEach(r=>TEAM[r.name]=r.team||\"미상\");\n     const teamColor = t => ({\"모바일개발팀\":\"#0052cc\",\"서비스개발팀\":\"#00875a\",\"플랫폼개발팀\":\"#974f0c\"}[t]||\"#6b778c\");\n     ``"});
